{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：11:02 2026-10-07 HKT<br/>發佈時間：11:02 2026-10-07 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：11:02 2026-10-07 HKT</p><p>今(7日)早上9時14分，啟德德朗邨內一名43歲男子踩單車，在屋邨車路往沐翠方向行駛，駛至德琦樓對開行人過路處，左邊突有途人行出過馬路，單車男扭右軚閃避失控倒地，重創一度昏迷，地上遺下血跡，救援人員接報到場，他稍後回復清醒，被送往伊利沙伯醫院救治。警方正調查事件。</p><img alt=\"現場遺下肇事單車。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ef1ab668bf9436718471cc2e65d9ee83/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-07_at_10_47_47_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/24603ffb940a8338699b9b845603dcc4/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-07_at_10_47_47_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警方封路調查事件。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e5ffb355ba098b338dd3630ddb221eaf/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-07_at_10_47_47.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"地面遺下血跡。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a591706c2a2dea404ee5d028e5e5b74b/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-07_at_10_47_46_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員到場調查。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4b4c0f380530038e8389eafae30142c5/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-07_at_10_47_46_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員到場調查。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b7acb886dde55ce14e9063facaf807d3/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-07_at_10_47_46.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c2769ebe855dc196cb4ff051fdf8f0c8/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-07_at_10_47_45.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"傷者送院治理。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/129868285f617cab13e137d9dae9e2f5/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-07_at_10_51_14_1_.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-07T03:20:22.096644+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":215,"images":8,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}